# Two Hoarding Dragons: each one's dies ability finds only the card exiled by that same Dragon's enters ability (CR 607.2a).
# Bot1's first Dragon exiles Sol Ring (turn 1) and the second Mana Vault (turn 3). When Bot2's Terror kills the first Dragon
# on turn 4, its ability puts Sol Ring into Bot1's hand and Mana Vault stays in exile with the second Dragon.

